============================================================
Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-space along which Pi is preserved.
  Physically: simultaneous rescaling of variables that keeps the
  normalised enthalpy Pi (and therefore the pore fraction) invariant.

  Generator 1:
    P x exp(-0.382*eps), V x exp(+0.116*eps), A x exp(+0.887*eps), rho x exp(+0.052*eps), Lv x exp(+0.185*eps), gamma x exp(+0.089*eps), Tb x exp(-0.082*eps)
    Meaning: increase A while decrease P, increase V, increase rho, increase Lv, increase gamma, decrease Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 2:
    P x exp(+0.332*eps), V x exp(+0.215*eps), A x exp(+0.092*eps), rho x exp(+0.901*eps), Lv x exp(-0.060*eps), dT x exp(-0.095*eps), gamma x exp(-0.053*eps), Tb x exp(+0.077*eps)
    Meaning: increase rho while increase P, increase V, increase A, decrease Lv, decrease dT, decrease gamma, increase Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 3:
    P x exp(-0.092*eps), V x exp(-0.148*eps), k x exp(+0.982*eps)
    Meaning: increase k while decrease P, decrease V
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 4:
    P x exp(+0.372*eps), V x exp(-0.624*eps), A x exp(+0.119*eps), Lv x exp(+0.658*eps), gamma x exp(-0.126*eps), Tb x exp(+0.070*eps)
    Meaning: increase Lv while increase P, decrease V, increase A, decrease gamma, increase Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 5:
    P x exp(+0.316*eps), V x exp(+0.216*eps), A x exp(+0.088*eps), rho x exp(-0.096*eps), Lv x exp(-0.054*eps), dT x exp(+0.908*eps), Tb x exp(+0.073*eps)
    Meaning: increase dT while increase P, increase V, increase A, decrease rho, decrease Lv, increase Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 6:
    P x exp(+0.245*eps), V x exp(-0.186*eps), A x exp(+0.074*eps), Lv x exp(-0.154*eps), gamma x exp(+0.934*eps), Tb x exp(+0.050*eps)
    Meaning: increase gamma while increase P, decrease V, increase A, decrease Lv, increase Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 7:
    P x exp(-0.304*eps), A x exp(-0.089*eps), rho x exp(+0.050*eps), Lv x exp(+0.130*eps), gamma x exp(+0.066*eps), Tb x exp(+0.934*eps)
    Meaning: increase Tb while decrease P, decrease A, increase rho, increase Lv, increase gamma
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged


